WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.280
Welcome to the video on best practices for creating A+ content.

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:06.720
Using this tool,

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:11.360
you can describe your product features in a different way by including a unique

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:14.790
brand story, enhanced images, and text placements.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.240
Adding A+ to your product

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:21.520
detail pages can result in higher conversion rates, increased traffic, and

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.382
increased sales when used effectively.

00:00:23.382 --> 00:00:26.360
In order to add A+ content to your

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:29.960
listings, you would need to be a professional seller and have your brand

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.695
already enrolled in the Amazon brand registry.

00:00:32.695 --> 00:00:35.040
Only when this is done and

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:38.920
your listings have been created with a correct brand name, would you be able to

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:41.491
add A+ content for your listings?

00:00:41.491 --> 00:00:44.920
There are no fees associated with A+ content.

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:48.997
A+ content seems most appealing when it is short and succinct.

00:00:48.997 --> 00:00:50.480
Any content that is

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:55.320
overlong might not inspire a buyer to read it entirely.

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:56.640
Create comparisons with

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:58.293
your other items or models.

00:00:58.293 --> 00:01:01.600
To do this, you now have access to six additional

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:02.244
modules.

00:01:02.244 --> 00:01:08.680
Comparison chart, single image and sidebar, four image highlights, single

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:14.360
image and specs detail, single image and highlights, and image and light text

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:14.655
overlay.

00:01:14.655 --> 00:01:19.080
You can find these modules in the select new module page when you add a

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:20.895
module to your A+ template.

00:01:20.895 --> 00:01:23.800
Combine images with text to create a better

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:25.326
experience for the buyer.

00:01:25.326 --> 00:01:28.760
Ensure that the images are of high resolution as

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:31.905
images generally provide a better buyer experience.

00:01:31.905 --> 00:01:34.600
The A+ content needs to go

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:38.400
through the review process with the appropriate team to ensure that it meets

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:38.817
guidelines.

00:01:38.817 --> 00:01:44.240
After you've been approved, you'll be able to add A+ content only to

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:47.763
products that are part of your approved brand catalog.

00:01:47.763 --> 00:01:49.720
Next, let us get content

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:52.603
that is restricted or prohibited.

00:01:52.603 --> 00:01:56.640
One, mention of seller authorization such as

00:01:56.640 --> 00:02:00.000
product only sold by authorized resellers.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.800
Two, any warranty or guarantee

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:08.920
satisfaction claims or references to off Amazon return or refund references.

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:15.440
Three, pricing or promotion references such as affordable, cheap, bonus, free.

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:20.920
Language directing customers to purchase such as buy now, add to cart, get yours

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:23.197
now or shop with us.

00:02:23.197 --> 00:02:26.840
Four, information about shipping details such as free

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:29.109
shipping or shipping timelines.

00:02:29.109 --> 00:02:33.080
Five, use of copyright, trademark or registered

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:35.542
symbols anywhere in your text.

00:02:35.542 --> 00:02:39.480
Six, boastful comments such as top-selling product,

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:43.425
hottest product or number one selling product.

00:02:43.425 --> 00:02:45.680
Seven, time sensitive product

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:51.280
information such as on sale now, best new product of the year or references to

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:51.790
holidays.

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:56.890
Eight, adding more than two editorial or third-party quotes.

00:02:56.890 --> 00:02:57.400
Quotes

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.935
must be from well-known publications or public figures.

00:03:00.935 --> 00:03:01.720
Product award

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:04.940
information must be presented with a disclaimer.

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:07.240
Nine, blurry or low quality

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:07.785
images.

00:03:07.785 --> 00:03:11.597
Ten, images containing watermarks or unreadable text.

00:03:11.597 --> 00:03:14.320
Font size must be 16

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:17.680
or larger and readable against its background.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:20.080
11, any kind of restricted

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:20.422
text.

00:03:20.422 --> 00:03:25.560
This brings us to the end of this video on best practices for adding A+

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:26.230
content.

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:30.100
Thank you and happy selling on Amazon!
